## Acceptance Criteria

### AC-1: Functionality

- [ ] All pages render without errors
- [ ] Filters update visualizations correctly
- [ ] Data displays accurately match source queries

### AC-2: Performance

- [ ] Page loads in under {{ load_time | default("3 seconds") }} on target warehouse
- [ ] Large dataset queries use appropriate caching
- [ ] No unnecessary re-runs on filter changes (session state management)

### AC-3: User Experience

- [ ] Responsive layout works on standard screen sizes
- [ ] Error states show user-friendly messages (not stack traces)
- [ ] Loading indicators appear during long queries

### AC-4: Security

- [ ] User can only access data permitted by their role
- [ ] No sensitive data exposed in URL parameters or session state
- [ ] SQL injection is prevented (parameterized queries)

---

## Edge Cases

| Scenario | Expected Behavior |
|----------|-------------------|
| No data for selected filters | Show empty state message, not blank page |
| Query timeout | Show timeout message with retry button |
| User has no role assigned | Show access denied page with contact info |
| Concurrent users (>10) | App scales via warehouse; no session conflicts |
| Browser back/forward | Session state handles navigation gracefully |

